  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women-led organisations: Evidence of impact and a blueprint for inclusive women-led humanitarian action</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Purpose of the project is to increase awareness and buy-in across a range of humanitarian actors (UN agencies and other multilaterals, INGOs, likeminded bilateral donors, philanthropies) of the crucial role played by women-led organisations in crisis response, as well as the need and potential for a funding and coordination ecosystem that appropriately centres and resources these organisations, ultimately strengthening inclusive, locally-led humanitarian action</narrative>
  </description>
